{"id":"openai/gpt-image-2.5/sunburst/text-to-image","modelId":"dag69p4regj0jrqrufi0","isFavorited":false,"title":"GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst Text to Image","category":"text-to-image","tags":["realism","typography","stylized"],"shortDescription":"OpenAI's precision-focused image model, built for premium visual work, extra fidelity on intricate detail, in exchange for longer generation times.","thumbnailUrl":"https://v3b.fal.media/files/b/0aa9a3c6/xpKm5FzsZBuvm2Bf8xY7W.jpg","modelUrl":"https://fal.run/openai/gpt-image-2.5/sunburst/text-to-image","githubUrl":"","licenseType":"commercial","date":"2026-09-08T19:41:24.961Z","group":{"key":"gpt-25","label":"Text to Image Sunburst"},"pricingInfoOverride":"Text tokens (per 1M): **$5.00** input, **$1.25** cached, **$10.00** output.\nImage tokens (per 1M): **$8.00** input, **$2.00** cached, **$30.00** output. Changing the **quality** parameter significantly affects cost; by default we use **high**. Adjust it to your preference.\nSee the description at the bottom of this page for more details on how much canonical image sizes cost. Total cost is rounded up to the closest hundredth of a cent ($0.0001.)","machineType":null,"examples":["70225a35-ee4b-4b62-be75-66e1369a1e21"],"authSkippable":false,"status":"public","publishedAt":"2026-09-08T20:11:12.507Z","deprecated":false,"resultComparison":false,"hidePricing":false,"removed":false,"modelLab":"OpenAI","modelLabId":"d8m36bkregj5ka3lrdhg","modelFamily":"GPT Image 2.5","landingPageSlug":"gpt-image-2.5","hostingType":"proxy","kind":"inference","trainingEndpoints":[]}
<p>Text tokens (per 1M): <strong>$5.00</strong> input, <strong>$1.25</strong> cached, <strong>$10.00</strong> output.
Image tokens (per 1M): <strong>$8.00</strong> input, <strong>$2.00</strong> cached, <strong>$30.00</strong> output. Changing the <strong>quality</strong> parameter significantly affects cost; by default we use <strong>high</strong>. Adjust it to your preference.
See the description at the bottom of this page for more details on how much canonical image sizes cost. Total cost is rounded up to the closest hundredth of a cent ($0.0001.)</p>